  "description": "An island floating above the sea. On the pier of Outset Island, by the lookout, the Helmaroc King swoops down and carries Link there; an updraft off Outset is a second way up. Its boss arena holds a heart container; the warp out opens once it is taken. With the Story Notebook it is a quest in the notebook, \"The island in the sky\", that starts with a letter and ends with a reward of 100 rupees.",
